  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p><code>MarkupText</code> 与 <code>Text</code> 共用 Pango 渲染管线，但输入是 <strong>Pango 标记语言</strong>（类似 HTML 的标签文本）：你可以在字符串里直接写 <code>&lt;span&gt;</code>、<code>&lt;b&gt;</code>、<code>&lt;i&gt;</code>、<code>&lt;sub&gt;</code> 等标签，实现富文本排版，而不必事后按索引逐个改色。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "id": "MarkupText",
      "text": "MarkupText"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p><code>MarkupText</code> 用于渲染带 Pango 标记的富文本；标记标签在排版时生效，最终仍转成 SVG 矢量图形。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "inheritance",
      "chain": [
        "MarkupText",
        "SVGMobject",
        "VMobject",
        "Mobject"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<pre><code class=\"language-python\">MarkupText(\n    text: str,\n    fill_opacity: float = 1,\n    stroke_width: float = 0,\n    color: ParsableManimColor | None = None,\n    font_size: float = 48,\n    line_spacing: float = -1,\n    font: str = &quot;&quot;,\n    slant: str = &quot;NORMAL&quot;,\n    weight: str = &quot;NORMAL&quot;,\n    justify: bool = False,\n    gradient: Iterable[ParsableManimColor] | None = None,\n    tab_width: int = 4,\n    height: int | None = None,\n    width: int | None = None,\n    should_center: bool = True,\n    disable_ligatures: bool = False,\n    warn_missing_font: bool = True,\n)\n</code></pre>"
    },
    {
      "type": "params",
      "rows": [
        {
          "name": "<code>text</code>",
          "type": "str",
          "default": "—",
          "desc": "含 Pango 标记的文本"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>justify</code>",
          "type": "bool",
          "default": "False",
          "desc": "是否两端对齐（仅多行有效）"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>font_size</code>",
          "type": "float",
          "default": "48",
          "desc": "基础字号，可被标签内 <code>size</code> 覆盖"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>font</code> / <code>slant</code> / <code>weight</code>",
          "type": "str",
          "default": "\"NORMAL\"",
          "desc": "同 <code>Text</code>，标签内的对应属性优先"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>gradient</code>",
          "type": "Iterable[color] \\",
          "default": "None",
          "desc": "None"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>disable_ligatures</code>",
          "type": "bool",
          "default": "False",
          "desc": "禁用连字"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>注意：<code>MarkupText</code> <strong>没有</strong> <code>t2c</code>/<code>t2f</code>/<code>t2g</code>/<code>t2s</code>/<code>t2w</code> 参数——颜色、字体等效果都通过标记标签实现。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "id": "常用标签",
      "text": "常用标签"
    },
    {
      "type": "compare",
      "headers": [
